{%- comment -%}
  Naira Flore icon: search.
  Ported from lucide `search`. Stroke 1.5 on a 24x24 grid; colour comes
  from the parent through `currentColor`.

  Accepts:
  - size: {Number} pixel box, defaults to 20

  Usage: {% render 'nf-icon-search', size: 20 %}
{%- endcomment -%}
